    "body": "This reduction of L-meta-2718 splits the 63-gate question for the projective plane of order three into four steps. It uses a binary-gate count to choose a minimal circuit. A safe bypass rules out the high-degree branch, and the low-degree branch reduces to a 64-gate bound for circuits computing incidence exactly.\n\nThe gate-bypass lemma and the low-degree exactness lemma have separate local Lean proofs. The safe-bypass existence and exact-circuit lower bound remain open. The submitted reduction passed the project checker locally.\n",
