    "draft": false,
    "body": "This reduction restricts L-meta-2718 to circuits in which each gate reads two distinct earlier wires and the output wire exists. The proof preserves the truth value on both the incident pairs and the degenerate maximal false inputs.\n\nThe normalization hypothesis is the 26-input instance of the checked L-meta-2006 theorem.\n",
